ARTICLE 8 — EXPORT CONTROL AND SANCTIONS
===============================================================================

8.1 Export Control Compliance. You must comply with all applicable export
    control laws and regulations of the People's Republic of China, the United
    States, the European Union, and any other applicable jurisdiction,
    including but not limited to:
    (a) the Export Control Law of the People's Republic of China;
    (b) the U.S. Export Administration Regulations (EAR) administered by the
        Bureau of Industry and Security (BIS);
    (c) the EU Dual-Use Regulation (Regulation (EU) 2021/821);
    (d) any applicable encryption export control regulations;
    (e) any applicable AI-specific export control regulations, including
        restrictions on the export of AI software, AI models, and AI-related
        technology.

8.2 No Export to Restricted Persons or Destinations. You may not, directly or
    indirectly, export, re-export, transfer, or make available the Software or
    any Derivative Work to:
    (a) any country, territory, or person subject to comprehensive sanctions
        or embargoes by any applicable jurisdiction;
    (b) any person or entity listed on any applicable sanctions list,
        including but not limited to the U.S. Treasury Department's Office of
        Foreign Assets Control (OFAC) Specially Designated Nationals and
        Blocked Persons List, the EU Consolidated List of Persons, Groups and
        Entities Subject to EU Financial Sanctions, and any Chinese government
        sanctions list;
    (c) any person or entity engaged in activities prohibited by applicable
        export control or sanctions laws, including but not limited to
        activities related to weapons of mass destruction, military
        proliferation, terrorism, or human rights abuses;
    (d) any end use that is prohibited by applicable export control laws,
        including but not limited to nuclear, chemical, or biological weapons
        proliferation, missile technology development, or military end uses
        where prohibited.

