     (e) any breach that causes material harm to the Licensor or any third
         party;
     (f) any breach of Article 5 (Commercial Use Authorization), Article 6
         (Data Privacy and Security), Article 7 (Responsible AI Use), Article 8
         (Export Control), or Article 12 (Enforcement and Remedies).

12.5 Audit Rights. If you hold a valid Commercial Authorization, the Licensor
