APPENDIX C — PROHIBITED USES LIST
===============================================================================

This Appendix C sets forth a non-exhaustive list of Prohibited Uses under
Article 7. The Licensor may update this list from time to time by posting an
updated version in the Software's official repository.

C.1 Illegal Content and Activities
    You may not use the Software or its Derivative Works to:
    (a) generate, distribute, or facilitate any content that is illegal under
        applicable law, including but not limited to child sexual abuse material
        (CSAM), bestiality, or non-consensual sexual content;
    (b) generate, distribute, or facilitate content that incites violence,
        terrorism, or hatred against any group based on race, ethnicity,
        national origin, religion, gender, sexual orientation, disability, or
        any other protected characteristic;
    (c) generate, distribute, or facilitate content that constitutes harassment,
        bullying, stalking, or doxxing of any individual;
    (d) generate, distribute, or facilitate defamatory, libelous, or slanderous
        content;
    (e) generate, distribute, or facilitate content that infringes any third
        party's intellectual property rights, including but not limited to
        copyright, trademark, patent, or trade secret rights;
    (f) facilitate any illegal activity, including but not limited to fraud,
        money laundering, drug trafficking, weapons manufacturing, or human
        trafficking.

C.2 Harmful AI Outputs
    You may not use the Software or its Derivative Works to:
    (a) generate deepfakes or synthetic media that depicts real individuals
        without their consent, including but not limited to non-consensual
        intimate imagery (NCII), fake speeches, or fake actions;
    (b) generate content designed to spread disinformation, misinformation, or
        manipulate elections, public opinion, or financial markets;
    (c) generate content that provides instructions for causing harm to oneself
        or others, including but not limited to instructions for suicide,
        self-harm, violence, or the manufacture of weapons, explosives, or
        dangerous substances;
    (d) generate content that violates the privacy rights of any individual,
        including but not limited to generating personal information about
        identifiable individuals without their consent;
    (e) deploy AI systems that make autonomous decisions with material real-world
        effects without adequate human oversight, including but not limited to
        decisions regarding employment, credit, insurance, housing, healthcare,
        education, or access to essential services;
    (f) use AI systems for mass surveillance, social scoring, or predictive
        policing in a manner that violates applicable law or human rights.

C.3 Security Abuse
    You may not use the Software or its Derivative Works to:
    (a) develop, distribute, or facilitate malware, ransomware, spyware,
        trojans, worms, or any other malicious software;
    (b) conduct or facilitate unauthorized access to computer systems, networks,
        or data (hacking), including but not limited to brute-force attacks,
        credential stuffing, or exploitation of security vulnerabilities;
    (c) conduct or facilitate denial-of-service (DoS) or distributed
        denial-of-service (DDoS) attacks;
    (d) circumvent, disable, or interfere with any security features, content
        filters, or access controls implemented in the Software or any AI model
        accessed through the Software;
    (e) attempt to jailbreak, prompt-inject, or otherwise manipulate any AI
        model to produce harmful, illegal, or prohibited content;
    (f) extract, copy, or reverse engineer any AI model weights or proprietary
        algorithms accessed through the Software, except as expressly permitted
        by the applicable upstream license.

C.4 Commercial Misuse
    You may not use the Software or its Derivative Works to:
    (a) engage in any Commercial Use without a valid Commercial Authorization
        issued under Article 5;
    (b) misrepresent the source, origin, or capabilities of the Software or any
        AI model accessed through the Software;
    (c) use the Software or any AI model accessed through the Software to
        compete with the Licensor's own commercial products or services, except
        as expressly authorized by a valid Commercial Authorization;
    (d) remove, alter, or obscure any attribution, copyright notice, license
        information, or trademark notices contained in the Software;
    (e) use the name "Kevrai", "Kevrai Omni", or any variant thereof in a
        manner that implies or suggests affiliation, sponsorship, endorsement, or
        partnership with or by the Licensor, without the prior written consent of
        the Licensor.

C.5 Data Misuse
    You may not use the Software or its Derivative Works to:
    (a) process personal data or sensitive personal data in violation of
        applicable data protection laws and regulations;
    (b) transfer personal data across national borders in violation of applicable
        cross-border data transfer laws;
    (c) collect, process, or store personal data without providing required
        notices or obtaining required consents;
    (d) use the Software to scrape, harvest, or collect personal data from
        websites or online services in violation of applicable law or the terms
        of service of such websites or services;
    (e) retain User Data longer than necessary for the purpose for which it was
        collected, or after termination of this License, except as required by
        applicable law.

